  "sourceReference": "Authored crossover movement and choreography based on the stated version and equipment; not copied official animation and not certified frame-for-frame canon. Simple/air/ledge actions follow the actual simple profile; charge/special use the secondary profile.",
  "visualReview": {
    "complete": true,
    "outfit": "HL2 orange/charcoal HEV MkV, brown hair/goatee, black glasses and full gloves.",
    "weapons": "Simple and aerial/ledge get-up use crowbar. Secondary charge/special uses orange Gravity Gun with native captive metal prop only before release; separate32 super uses blue Citadel gun. Movement/defense/hanging hands free.",
    "limitations": [
      "Original adapted crossover choreography; no certified official1:1 animation or exported game frames.",
      "Runtime facing mirrors the native source, including costume asymmetry.",
      "Ledge-only source uses a head-to-sole hanging reference with raised hands excluded; this is not certified as an upright standing anatomy reference."
    ]
